Two parts of the operations request are not included. The node's `with Clock` clause grants only `wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0`. It has no filesystem or HTTP authority, so it cannot append to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or call the metadata service. Adding them would need new capability grants in the graph, not changes to this body. The node only reads the clock, and its output is unchanged.

